1
00:00:00,773 --> 00:00:03,443
(Sheldon:)somewhere
beyond our solar system,

2
00:00:03,442 --> 00:00:06,142
(Raj:)going further than anyone
ever thought it could.

3
00:00:09,548 --> 00:00:12,218
Don't leave!
You can do this!

4
00:00:14,186 --> 00:00:16,186
(Bernadette:)Sheldon,
is everything okay?

5
00:00:16,188 --> 00:00:17,758
(Sheldon:)It's too late for Koothrappali.

6
00:00:17,757 --> 00:00:18,657
Let's go!

7
00:00:21,293 --> 00:00:24,963
(Amy:)11 minutes.
That's longer than I thought.

8
00:00:25,965 --> 00:00:27,465
KOOTHRAPPALI:
They're in my shirt!

9
00:00:27,466 --> 00:00:29,496
They're in my shirt!
They're in my shirt!

10
00:00:33,439 --> 00:00:35,709
(Penny:)Okay, this is definitely
the most fun thing we can do

11
00:00:35,708 --> 00:00:36,778
(Penny:)with the money.

12
00:00:39,812 --> 00:00:43,752
(Leonard:)I've never done it on
a big old pile of cash before.

13
00:00:46,052 --> 00:00:50,322
(high-pitched):
"Me neither, Leonard.
It's my first time, too."

14
00:00:53,959 --> 00:00:57,129
(Bernadette:)I'm so sorry I made you feel bad
about the money stuff.

15
00:00:57,129 --> 00:01:00,299
(Howard:)It's okay.
No, it's not okay.

16
00:01:00,299 --> 00:01:02,629
(Bernadette:)I want us to be
partners, equals.

17
00:01:02,635 --> 00:01:05,305
(Bernadette:)Adults in a mature
relationship.

18
00:01:05,304 --> 00:01:07,374
(Howard:)I want that, too.

19
00:01:08,908 --> 00:01:11,108
(Bernadette:)Now, let's talk about
your birthday party.

20
00:01:11,110 --> 00:01:13,440
(Howard:)Ooh, laser tag,
laser tag.
Oh!

21
00:01:15,681 --> 00:01:17,981
(Amy:)Do you really need me
to transcribe this?

22
00:01:17,983 --> 00:01:19,313
(Sheldon:)You're not doing it for me.

23
00:01:19,318 --> 00:01:21,318
(Sheldon:)You're doing it
for future generations

24
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:23,820
(Sheldon:)who will benefit
from my struggle.

25
00:01:25,191 --> 00:01:27,691
(Sheldon:)Sheldon's Mine Simulation Log,

26
00:01:27,693 --> 00:01:30,193
entry four:

27
00:01:30,196 --> 00:01:33,996
(Sheldon:)my Kit Kat has melted.

28
00:01:33,999 --> 00:01:37,499
(Sheldon:)All is lost.

29
00:01:37,503 --> 00:01:40,033
(Raj:)You call yourself
a friend?!

30
00:01:40,039 --> 00:01:41,309
(Raj:)I was trying

31
00:01:41,307 --> 00:01:43,637
to help you!
And at the first sign of trouble

32
00:01:43,642 --> 00:01:48,782
(Raj:)you ran away, leaving me
to fend off a family of rats!

33
00:01:48,781 --> 00:01:51,111
(Raj:)You're a completely selfish
human being

34
00:01:51,117 --> 00:01:54,787
(Raj:)and a... and a physical
and a moral coward!

35
00:01:56,222 --> 00:01:59,652
(Sheldon:)His statements of the obvious
continue to annoy.

